  "description": "### GTIF AT EA – Austrian Climate Change Explorer for Tourism\n\n\n\n\n\n*Tourism indicators: Tourism and climate correlation analysis*\n\n\n\nDaily precipitation sum, maximum temperature, and snow depth data are spatially aggregated to Austrian tourism destinations for the period 2023-2026 during winter (November-April) and summer (May-October) seasons. Snow depth values are considered only during the winter season. The climate variables are subsequently linked with forecasted overnight stays for the corresponding tourism regions.\n\n\n\nBy selecting a tourist destination on the map, the graphical representations of the relationship between overnight stays and climate factors (mean precipitation sum, maximum temperature, and mean snow depth) during the winter and/or summer seasons can be explored.\n\n\n\nRead narrative (general) and (use case 3) for a more detailed description.\n",
